   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"12\">\n    <li>The percentage of voters ages 18 to 29 who participated in each United States presidential election between the years 1988 and 2016 is shown in the table.</li>\n  </ol>\n<table class=\"os-raise-horizontaltable unnumbered\">\n<thead></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n              Year\n            </th>\n<td>\n              1988\n            </td>\n<td>\n              1992\n            </td>\n<td>\n              1996\n            </td>\n<td>\n              2000\n            </td>\n<td>\n              2004\n            </td>\n<td>\n              2008\n            </td>\n<td>\n              2012\n            </td>\n<td>\n              2016\n            </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n              Percentage of voters ages 18–29\n            </th>\n<td>\n              35.7\n            </td>\n<td>\n              42.7\n            </td>\n<td>\n              33.1\n            </td>\n<td>\n              34.5\n            </td>\n<td>\n              45.0\n            </td>\n<td>\n              48.4\n            </td>\n<td>\n              40.9\n            </td>\n<td>\n              43.4\n            </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The function <span data-math=\"P\">P</span> gives the percent of voters ages 18 to 29 years old who participated in the election in year <span data-math=\"t\">t</span>.</p>\n<p>Determine the average rate of change for <span data-math=\"P\">P</span> between 1992 and 2000.</p>",
   "answers": [
